Description: R port of the QUARC Nonlinear library from the Quantitative
    Analysis Research Core at the Center for Human Movement Variability,
    University of Nebraska at Omaha. The MATLAB implementation is the
    specification; every ported function is tested against MATLAB's answers
    on shared fixtures.
